 "vyzhimka": {
  "tekst": "If by “get ChatGPT to name my company” you mean “help my company appear when Americans ask ChatGPT for recommendations,” there are now several legitimate routes.\n\n- ChatGPT Ads: U.S. businesses can buy ads that appear alongside relevant conversations. Ads are clearly labeled and are separate from ChatGPT’s answers, so paying does not buy a favorable organic recommendation. OpenAI has a self-serve Ads Manager, with sales support for larger advertisers. ([ads.openai.com](https://ads.openai.com/?utm_source=openai))\n- Shopping/product discovery: If you sell products, ChatGPT can organically surface your products based on relevance. Merchants can provide catalog information through OpenAI's Agentic Commerce infrastructure; Shopify merchant product data is already integrated through Shopify Catalog. ([help.openai.com](https://help.openai.com/en/articles/11128490-improved-shopping-results-from-chatgpt-search?utm_source=openai))\n- Organic mentions in answers/research: There isn't an official service where a company can pay OpenAI to make ChatGPT recommend it organically. ChatGPT's shopping results, for example, are explicitly selected independently from ads. Making your company easy to discover and verify on authoritative public sources can matter when ChatGPT researches the web. ([help.openai.com](https://help.openai.com/en/articles/11128490-improved-shopping-results-from-chatgpt-search?utm_source=openai))\n\nIf you're actually asking “what U.S. agencies/consultants specialize in getting brands mentioned by ChatGPT?” — often marketed as GEO, AEO, or AI-search optimization — I can identify the strongest U.S. firms doing that and compare what they charge and what they can realistically accomplish.",
  "poiskovye_zaprosy": [
